<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA TRADE GAP GROWS TO $133 MLN IN JAN-APRIL.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA TRADE GAP GROWS TO $133 MLN IN JAN-APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's foreign trade deficit</p>
<p>widened to $133 million in Jan-April of 1997 from $105 million</p>
<p>in the same period in 1996, the State Statistics Department</p>
<p>said.</p>
<p> MOLDOVAN FOREIGN TRADE	 Jan-April'97  Jan-April'96</p>
<p> Exports			     243.6	   231.1</p>
<p> Imports			     376.6	   336.2</p>
<p> Balance			    -133.0	  -105.1</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
